window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b><i>He showed up to punish her brother, but he stayed to break her instead.</i></b><br><br><b>Lina</b><br>He wasn’t supposed to come for me. I wasn’t the one who stole. But Nico walked through my door like he owned it, and the second his eyes landed on me, on my chest leaking through my shirt, I knew everything had changed. He’s not just an enforcer. He’s a monster with rules, with patience, with a hunger that leaves me full and aching. He feeds from me like it’s sacred. Uses me like I was made for him. And the worst part is, I don’t want to stop him.<br><br><b>Nico</b><br>She’s Marco’s sister. That should’ve made her off-limits. But the second I saw her, dripping and desperate, all that restraint went to hell. She’s soft where I’m sharp, leaking where I’m starving, and every time she obeys, I push her further. I use her mouth, her milk, her moans. I make her beg. And I don’t regret a fucking thing. Because she’s mine now. Ruined. Collared. Kept.<br><br><b><i>Be aware, this book is a short steamy romance with an ABF kink. If that troubles you, don't click on it.</i></b><br><br>🔥 Bully Romance 🖤 Mafia Enforcer x Innocent Sister 🔥 Lactation Kink 💔 Captive Obsession 💦 Breastfeeding Control 😈 Collar and Submission 💥 Shame and Heat 🌙 Mafia Power Play 🔗 Ownership, Not Love 🥵 “You Leak for Me, No One Else”<br>"; 
